  "body": "**IGNORE CV**\r\n\r\nSOLID CONCRETE CONSTRUCTION. \r\n\r\nTucked away in one of Kohimarama's most desirable and tightly held positions, this architecturally designed residence offers an exceptional setting for family life. Combining enduring concrete block construction with contemporary style, generous proportions and a welcoming sense of comfort, it is a home designed for connection, relaxation and easy care living.\r\n\r\nSet back from the road behind electric gates on a 496sqm freehold site, the property offers privacy, security and peace of mind. Spread across two spacious levels, it provides room for everyone to come together, along with quiet spaces to retreat and unwind.\r\n\r\nNorth-facing and filled with sunshine, the home enjoys abundant natural light throughout the day. A neutral interior palette creates a calm and timeless backdrop, while the thoughtfully designed floor plan caters beautifully to families of all ages and stages.\r\n\r\nFrench doors open from the living and dining areas onto a generous timber deck, creating an effortless connection between the indoors and out. Overlooking the swimming/spa pool and easy-care gardens, this is an inviting setting for children to play, friends to gather and summer evenings to linger over.\r\n\r\nFour bedrooms, a dedicated study and three bathrooms provide excellent flexibility for family living, guests and working from home. Ample storage keeps daily life organised, while the double internal-access garage and generous off-street parking add valuable convenience.\r\n\r\nWith its superb indoor-outdoor flow, sun-filled interiors, poolside setting and sought-after Kohimarama location, this is far more than a beautiful home-it is a place to settle in, grow and enjoy the very best of family living.",
